        <mxCell id="rt-dep" value="&lt;b style='font-size:12px'&gt;runtime.yml · deploy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:11px;color:#52606D'&gt;verify the signature and provenance first&lt;br&gt;terraform plan / apply terraform/runtime with that digest&lt;br&gt;warden-ops-migrate: the audit's schema and writer login&lt;br&gt;every zone service runs the image just built&lt;br&gt;restart: a fresh deployment after a secret changes&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1F2933;fontSize=12;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9AA5B1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
